{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDI0L0NhbnQlMjBGZWVsJTIwTm90aGluZyUyMCUyODIwMjQlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Cant Feel Nothing","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/9sAs1DSymyqRmcbqSW4TuX1y5Zu.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/apBEQ0shKkZ1jYdk7Gd2si3duvd.jpg","description":"A man lies in bed illuminated by the blue-white light of his mobile phone. He doom scrolls past cute pets, outraged opinion pieces and haunting images from the world's hotspots – and he feels absolutely nothing. With curiousity and humour, director David Borenstein travels the world to investigate how bad things really are. Who is pulling the strings when the internet makes us angry, sad, horny or just plain indifferent? And is there any way back? From the American internet troll, a burnt-out superstar in the Asian influencer industry, a cynical fake-news factory in Eastern Europe, Russian state propagandists and an online dominatrix, this is an alarming contemporary diagnosis, with a bold attempt to also look at solutions.\n\nReleased 13 Mar 2024 · Denmark, Germany · Language: English · 81 min\nStudio: FilmFyn, ZDF, New Danish Screen\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2024","genres":["Documentary","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"8.0","imdb_id":"tt27634865","moviedb_id":1220044,"tmdbId":1220044,"runtime":"81 min","cast":["David Borenstein","Mistress Harley"],"director":["David Borenstein"],"writer":["David Borenstein"],"released":"2024-03-13T00:00:00.000Z","country":"Denmark, Germany, Norway","language":"English","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"David Borenstein","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hnZXlNc9eNmOkpU5iU6pMAa75iW.jpg"},{"name":"David Borenstein","character":"Himself","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hnZXlNc9eNmOkpU5iU6pMAa75iW.jpg"},{"name":"Mistress Harley","character":"Self","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ohCnYRlulRXX5EAwRHxJ9vmmQrj.jpg"}]},"links":[{"name"